"""
Unlok Maya Toolbox
==================

Paste this whole file into the Maya Script Editor (Python tab) and run it.
It is fully self-contained: no other files, folders or third-party packages.

Target: Maya 2023 (Python 3.9, PySide2). Also runs on 2024/2025.

Tools
-----
Modeling
    Path Scatter  - draw a path on any surface and scatter / array objects
                    along it (presets or your own meshes), with rows, stagger,
                    randomness and bake to instances, copies or one mesh.
    Bevel Resolver - turn the n-gons a chamfer-off bevel leaves at its ends
                     into clean SubD quads, mesh-wide or on a selection.
    Log Noise     - turn cylinders into natural-looking logs.
    Rope Lashing  - tie logs together the way real lashings are tied
                    (square, diagonal, round, sheer), with clean UVs.
    Roof          - roofs from a box: gable / hip / half-hip ends, lean-to
                    or cone, covered in thatch (a displaced surface, straw
                    planes, 3D pieces, leaf panels or palm fronds on stacked
                    UVs) or corrugated metal (clean sheets or makeshift
                    panels), on a timber frame.
UV
    Smart UDIM    - sort an asset into UDIM sections and material groups
                    (plain Maya sets, UnlokRenamer naming), clean geometry
                    and report UV problems before layout.
Naming
    Renamer       - UnlokRenamer: name geometry and groups to the Unlok
                    convention, and check a hierarchy (duplicates, invalid
                    names, soft warnings, material variants) with fixes.
Camera
    Reframe       - match a camera to concept art or a photo by clicking
                    matching points on the model and the image (position,
                    rotation, focal length, lens shift).
"""

